		Heading 1:
			Text: Images in the sentence
		Paragraph: With `Markup: markdown`, an image written as in Markdown goes within the line, as tall as the letters and aligned with them. It behaves like one more word. The text in brackets is what a screen reader reads, and empty brackets make it decorative.
			Style: intro
		Text: Included ![Yes](documents/check.svg) in every plan, excluded ![No](documents/cross.svg) in the basic one.
